
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.GetObjectPrimCount(ObjectID: uuid): number`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer llGetObjectPrimCount(key ObjectID);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns an integer that is the total number of prims in the object that contains <b>prim</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>uuid</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>key</span></td>
          <td>ObjectID / prim</td>
          <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Prim" target="_blank">prim</a> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/UUID" target="_blank">UUID</a> that is in the same <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Region" target="_blank">region</a></td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>object</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">323</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-mandatory">Use Return</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>Avatars sitting on the object are not counted[[1]](#footnote_1). Zero is returned if <b>prim</b>: (A) is not found, (B) is part of an attachment[[2]](#footnote_2), or (C) is not a prim.</p>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>This cannot be used to detect if an avatar is seated (by checking for a non-zero return), use <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetAgentInfo" target="_blank">llGetAgentInfo</a> instead.</li>
    <li>The prim count for attachments are not returned[[2]](#footnote_2). If possible use <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetNumberOfPrims" target="_blank">llGetNumberOfPrims</a> instead.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`function LLEvents.touch_start(events)
    local num = #events
    local prims = ll.GetObjectPrimCount(ll.GetKey())
    if prims == 0 then
        -- llGetObjectPrimCount returns zero for attachments.
        prims = ll.GetNumberOfPrims()
    -- Avatars can't sit on attachments so this is ok.
    end
    ll.OwnerSay("This object has " .. tostring(prims) .. " prims and " .. tostring(ll.GetNumberOfPrims() - prims) .. " avatars.")
end
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default
{
    touch_start(integer num)
    {
        integer prims = llGetObjectPrimCount(llGetKey());
        if (prims == 0)
        {
            // llGetObjectPrimCount returns zero for attachments.
            prims = llGetNumberOfPrims();
            // Avatars can't sit on attachments so this is ok.
        }
        llOwnerSay("This object has "
                    + (string)prims
                    + " prims and "
                    + (string)(llGetNumberOfPrims() - prims)
                    + " avatars.");
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
